==German==

===Etymology===
From a word with the meaning of hill (compare dialectal {{m|de|Mugel||hillock}}), not related with {{m|de|Maul||mouth}}. More at {{m|en|mouldwarp}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|de|De-Maulwurf.ogg}}
* {{a|Austria}} {{audio|de|De-at-Maulwurf.ogg}}

